{"completed": true, "response": "他一直想说的那件事，其实很明确。此刻他感到温柔和满足，是因为他珍惜的那个人本来就和他很亲近，而这份亲近也确实让他感到满足。他不是先放下顾虑，才让自己开心。正因为他在乎对方，也在乎两人现在的关系，所以他既想让对方知道自己的心意，又担心说出口会带来什么后果，这两种想法始终同时存在。即使有一刻，他更迫切地想说出自己的心意，也不代表他已经决定开口；他依然有所顾虑，却没有因此放弃自己的愿望。那份始终无法完全消散的惆怅，是因为眼前的美好和亲近都是真实的，而他想说的事又可能改变这一切。他暂时还在这两种想法之间，不必在这一段就急着想明白或解决。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a0f8e2d6-1fb1-4c35-ac1e-2c0cb3ac468e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002856295720Z", "elapsed_seconds": 8.922, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:29:05.220866+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7c9784ad356dd58528bcc68095bbaa24f1e978adbbf1d87582326a57b220abdc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs